Poll the reindex job until `status = completed`. The `payload.result` block reports how many chunks were created per entity type.

## Response `200` (completed)
```json
{
  "id": "<uuid>",
  "type": "reindex_org",
  "status": "completed",
  "payload": {
    "result": {
      "status": "completed",
      "chunks": 142,
      "by_entity": {
        "org": 1,
        "controls": 48,
        "issues": 30,
        "aggregate": 1,
        "risks": 55,
        "risk_tags": 5,
        "assignments": 2
      }
    }
  },
  "error": null
}
```

